<entry align="left">1 in. Hg = 3386 Pa<newline/>notað í flugiðnaði, einnig í sumum veðurskeytum</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">torr</entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>1 torr</m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mtext>1</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mtext>760</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>atm</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math><newline/>nefnt eftir Evangelista Torricelli, uppfinningamanni loftvogarinnar</entry>
</row>
